    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## ❓ FAQ\n",
    "\n",
    "**Q: How much memory can I store?**\n",
    "A: Limited by context window. Summarize if too long.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Q: What's the difference between memory and state?**\n",
    "A: Memory = conversation history, State = task context.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Q: Can state be shared between agents?**\n",
    "A: Yes, with proper persistence!\n",
    "\n",
    "**Q: How do I prevent memory from growing too large?**\n",
    "A: Use truncation/summarization at token thresholds."
   ]
  },
